# cobot_operation: convert EVERY stored teach point (runtime_config/
# trajectories.json) to `to_tool` via /cobot/convert_pose (controller
# kinematics, no motion) and persist. All-or-nothing: on any failure the
# file is left untouched.
int32 to_tool -1       # -1 = the controller's current active tool
---
bool success
string message
int32 to_tool          # resolved tool number
int32 converted        # poses rewritten (0 when already in that frame)
